      "body": "Someone attempted a quant of Qwen 2.5 Coder as well:\n\nhttps://huggingface.co/tzervas/qwen2.5-coder-32b-bitnet-1.58b\n\nThe 2B model was great proof of concept - why is Microsoft sleeping on this? Does it not scale as they expected? 🤔\n",
